{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/2dfa74ceeeb5ab9fb62f35ed44a673c7.poster.avif?t=1768099100\" width=600 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/2dfa74ceeeb5ab9fb62f35ed44a673c7.webm?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/2dfa74ceeeb5ab9fb62f35ed44a673c7.mp4?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/98d4c7540f7172b0259890b6a0f64269.poster.avif?t=1768099100\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/98d4c7540f7172b0259890b6a0f64269.webm?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/98d4c7540f7172b0259890b6a0f64269.mp4?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Congratulations\u2014you\u2019ve just landed the worst job of your life.</strong><br>Forget desks, stamps, and boring paperwork. Here, you\u2019re a debt collector for the mob, and your \u201chome visits\u201d look less like routine inspections and more like desperate survival missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/ade4eebc776b91a80306cae72da66124.poster.avif?t=1768099100\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/ade4eebc776b91a80306cae72da66124.webm?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/ade4eebc776b91a80306cae72da66124.mp4?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your clients? Not ordinary tenants behind on rent. Think basement <strong>chemists with secret labs, trappers who lace every hallway with snares, and a full gallery of lunatics</strong> who\u2019d rather turn their flat into a war zone than hand over a dime. Every debtor is a unique challenge\u2014new traps, new behavior, new ways to send you to an early grave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/d15b4eb9bf8bddfc36c591e4ead5c37d.poster.avif?t=1768099100\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/d15b4eb9bf8bddfc36c591e4ead5c37d.webm?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/d15b4eb9bf8bddfc36c591e4ead5c37d.mp4?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your job sounds simple: <strong>go in, grab whatever you can, and get out alive</strong>. In practice, it means dodging explosions, disarming bizarre contraptions, searching every corner, and praying your teammate doesn\u2019t press the one thing they absolutely shouldn\u2019t. If anything can go wrong\u2014it will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/a915a9b8292c8113a77226b2c1c8d056.poster.avif?t=1768099100\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/a915a9b8292c8113a77226b2c1c8d056.webm?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/a915a9b8292c8113a77226b2c1c8d056.mp4?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You don\u2019t have to work alone. Team up and raid debtor hideouts together to boost your odds of success\u2014or at least have someone to blame when everything blows up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the day, the mafia doesn\u2019t care about excuses. They only care about what you bring back. Will you return as a clever debt enforcer or end up as another unlucky expense in the books? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The weirdest job ever</strong> \u2013 a repo man armed with a crowbar and flashlight instead of a folder of paperwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique debtors</strong> \u2013 each with their own personality, hazards, and twisted ways to get rid of you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op</strong> \u2013 brave it solo or form a crew where someone\u2019s always responsible for the next explosion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless risk</strong> \u2013 every mission brings new, unpredictable situations ready to spiral out of control.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963300?t=1768099100","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/2c528e1133b50ea1bf5048521e1ea536a4c47035/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768099100","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/7ca96fcd3d007f3a47fdcb16f496caa2dd92cfa6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768099100","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/7ca96fcd3d007f3a47fdcb16f496caa2dd92cfa6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768099100","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/2dfa74ceeeb5ab9fb62f35ed44a673c7.poster.avif?t=1768099100\" width=600 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/2dfa74ceeeb5ab9fb62f35ed44a673c7.webm?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/2dfa74ceeeb5ab9fb62f35ed44a673c7.mp4?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/98d4c7540f7172b0259890b6a0f64269.poster.avif?t=1768099100\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/98d4c7540f7172b0259890b6a0f64269.webm?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/98d4c7540f7172b0259890b6a0f64269.mp4?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Congratulations\u2014you\u2019ve just landed the worst job of your life.</strong><br>Forget desks, stamps, and boring paperwork. Here, you\u2019re a debt collector for the mob, and your \u201chome visits\u201d look less like routine inspections and more like desperate survival missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/ade4eebc776b91a80306cae72da66124.poster.avif?t=1768099100\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/ade4eebc776b91a80306cae72da66124.webm?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/ade4eebc776b91a80306cae72da66124.mp4?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your clients? Not ordinary tenants behind on rent. Think basement <strong>chemists with secret labs, trappers who lace every hallway with snares, and a full gallery of lunatics</strong> who\u2019d rather turn their flat into a war zone than hand over a dime. Every debtor is a unique challenge\u2014new traps, new behavior, new ways to send you to an early grave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/d15b4eb9bf8bddfc36c591e4ead5c37d.poster.avif?t=1768099100\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/d15b4eb9bf8bddfc36c591e4ead5c37d.webm?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/d15b4eb9bf8bddfc36c591e4ead5c37d.mp4?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your job sounds simple: <strong>go in, grab whatever you can, and get out alive</strong>. In practice, it means dodging explosions, disarming bizarre contraptions, searching every corner, and praying your teammate doesn\u2019t press the one thing they absolutely shouldn\u2019t. If anything can go wrong\u2014it will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/a915a9b8292c8113a77226b2c1c8d056.poster.avif?t=1768099100\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/a915a9b8292c8113a77226b2c1c8d056.webm?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/extras/a915a9b8292c8113a77226b2c1c8d056.mp4?t=1768099100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You don\u2019t have to work alone. Team up and raid debtor hideouts together to boost your odds of success\u2014or at least have someone to blame when everything blows up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the day, the mafia doesn\u2019t care about excuses. They only care about what you bring back. Will you return as a clever debt enforcer or end up as another unlucky expense in the books? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The weirdest job ever</strong> \u2013 a repo man armed with a crowbar and flashlight instead of a folder of paperwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique debtors</strong> \u2013 each with their own personality, hazards, and twisted ways to get rid of you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op</strong> \u2013 brave it solo or form a crew where someone\u2019s always responsible for the next explosion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless risk</strong> \u2013 every mission brings new, unpredictable situations ready to spiral out of control.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Patologgia Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963300/386537b3d48251f3f799a1f451db897bdb210297/header.jpg?t=1768099100","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3963300/1443489047/46df928963869dc08a96ce4af7937decf2890c4e/1758236591/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758243353","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3963300/1443489047/46df928963869dc08a96ce4af7937decf2890c4e/1758236591/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758243353","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3963300/1443489047/46df928963869dc08a96ce4af7937decf2890c4e/1758236591/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758243353","id":257200745,"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257200745/f4a1ea78dc7a1baecdb0d6a9c0cfdd41275d91a0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758243353"}],"name":"REPOSSESSION: Mafia Debt","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit versions)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 6300 HQ | AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 950M 4GB | AMD RX 550 Mobile 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit versions)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 8500 | AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB | AMD RX 480 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux"